%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    title Order checkout — payment + fulfilment
    autonumber

    actor "Customer" as Cust
    participant "Web UI" as UI
    participant "Order API" as API
    participant "Payment Gateway" as PSP
    participant "Inventory" as INV
    participant "Postgres" as DB

    Cust->>UI: place order
    UI->>+API: POST /orders
    API->>+DB: BEGIN
    API->>+INV: reserve(items)
    INV-->>-API: reserved

    alt payment authorised
        API->>+PSP: authorize(amount)
        PSP-->>-API: approved(authId)
        API->>DB: INSERT order
        API->>DB: COMMIT
        API-->>UI: 201 Created
    else payment declined
        PSP-->>API: declined
        API->>INV: release(items)
        API->>DB: ROLLBACK
        API-->>UI: 402 Payment Required
    end

    deactivate DB
    deactivate API
    UI-->>Cust: show receipt

    Note right of API: Idempotency key on the<br/>POST /orders endpoint<br/>guards against retries.
